  "observations": [
    "The only existing production-file changes are an additive module export and a Gradle JSON sidecar; no UI, project publication, editor, theme or physical tree files change.",
    "Basic parse_model and generatedArtifacts decoding retain their schemas and ignore unrelated top-level sidecars. Gradle Basic and V2 field construction is unchanged.",
    "Each optional getter and all-projects catalogue invocation preserves available/unavailable state. Rust decoding returns typed facts errors, takes Basic model immutably, and has no publish/reset UI call.",
    "Project/root names, project paths, public build-tree paths, reference identity paths and nullable Idea module names remain raw observations. No imported-name fallback, collision rename, facet assignment or tree label is guessed.",
    "Retained full helper sources distinguish Gradle raw names, Idea names and later internal/qualified naming policy. Both public and reference paths remain distinct until authoritative observations justify equivalence.",
    "The existing physical tree and raw JSON Sync console limitation are explicitly retained in docs/android-studio/module-presentation-task-report.md:89-94. New sidecar output will also be visible there until the separate console filter task."
  ],
